  "content": "\n\n<h4>FTBLib 是一個專為我們所有模組設計的程式庫模組。允許在遊戲內編輯部分設定檔、在同一整合包中支援多種模式等。</h4>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2>&nbsp;FTB 模組家族：</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/ftb-utilities\" rel=\"nofollow\">FTB 實用工具</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/ftb-guides\" rel=\"nofollow\">FTB 指南</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/ftb-quests\" rel=\"nofollow\">FTB 任務</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/ftb-achievements\" rel=\"nofollow\">FTB&nbsp;成就</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/ftb-banners\" rel=\"nofollow\">FTB 旗幟</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/team-islands\" rel=\"nofollow\">團隊島嶼</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/ftb-tweaks\" rel=\"nofollow\">FTB 微調</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/ftb-money\" rel=\"nofollow\">FTB 貨幣</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/ftbtrophies\" rel=\"nofollow\">FTB 獎盃</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/ftblib/relations/dependents?filter-related-dependents=3\" rel=\"nofollow\">其他</a></li>\n</ul>",
